exports[`userPrompt > snapshots the report turn 1`] = `
"# Evaluation report

Explain how the run went.

## Where the evidence is
- The agent's final workspace: /workspace
- The task the agent was given: /bunsen/run/task/prompt.md
- Changes the agent made: /bunsen/run/workspace/diff.patch
- The agent's stdout and stderr: /bunsen/run/logs.txt
- The agent's model conversations: call list_threads, then read_thread_turns

## Task given to the agent
\`\`\`
Make the failing test pass.
\`\`\`

## Changes the agent made
(empty — the agent changed no files.)

## Criterion results
- tests-pass: 1.00 — All 42 tests pass.
- lint: not scored (gated)
- style: not scored (scorer error: the model never submitted a verdict)
- other: not scored — Nothing to grade

Call submit_report when you are done; the report is not recorded until you do."
`;
